  "methodology": "Prices for IME-traded commodities (rebar, billet, aluminum, copper, cement, bitumen, zinc, lead) are monthly weighted average settlement prices from the IME ring and spot markets. Non-exchange materials (beam IPE, sheets, profiles, aggregates) are derived using validated price-ratio models calibrated against weekly market bulletins from ISPA, Fouladban, and TGJU. All prices are in Iranian Rials (IRR) per kilogram. Per-ton values are obtained by multiplying by 1,000."
